{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 27, "model_name": "mistralai/mixtral-8x7b-instruct-v0.1", "content": " Upon the break of dawn, thou shalt arise and make thy way to the airport, where thy journey to Japan doth commence. Take heed, for this journey shall be one of great adventure and discovery.\n\nIn Tokyo, the bustling metropolis, thou shalt explore the Sensō-ji temple, a sacred place of worship for over a millennium. Gaze upon the vibrant hues of the temple's gates and immerse thyself in the rich culture and history of Japan.\n\nNext, venture to the Shibuya Crossing, where hundreds of pedestrians converge in a symphony of organized chaos. Thou shalt marvel at this spectacle and feel the pulse of the city.\n\nIn Kyoto, the former imperial capital, thou shalt visit the Fushimi Inari shrine, with its thousands of vermilion torii gates. Wander through the forest and feel the serenity of this holy place.\n\nIn Nara, the ancient capital, thou shalt encounter the friendly and gentle deer of Nara Park. Feed them and bask in their peaceful presence.\n\nAnd finally, in Hiroshima, pay tribute to the victims of the atomic bomb at the Peace Memorial Park. Reflect on the past and commit to a peaceful future.\n\nSeek out new experiences, forge connections with the locals, and savor the flavors of Japanese cuisine. May this journey bring thee joy, wonder, and growth. Fare thee well, and safe travels.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Upon", "logprob": -0.16018113493919373}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.012731345370411873}, {"token": "break", "logprob": -1.5558785200119019}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -3.814689989667386e-06}, {"token": "dawn", "logprob": -0.07057062536478043}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.0001411338453181088}, {"token": "thou", "logprob": -0.01869545318186283}, {"token": "sh", "logprob": -0.0017169271595776081}, {"token": "alt", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": "arise", "logprob": -0.0715327262878418}, {"token": "and", "logprob": -3.